<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>This macro works on zofia ar only </Major>
    <Description>TIP:  It works on the AR from zofia weapons put it on the fire button. and then Hold untill release!!

Sens 12Y 12X 800DPI 

Res 1920 x 1080 144hz

aspect rario 4:3 90 fov 

I gonna make more scripts for siege if u need help add my dc: Decco#9234</Description>
